  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fde643f5ad18ae1419806a0d1f925213, type: 3}
  m_Name: PrivacyPolicyConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Configs::Monk.Configs.TextContentConfig
  title: PRIVACY POLICY
  body: 'Privacy Policy


    Last updated: February 2026


    1. Information We
    Collect

    We do not collect personal information. The game may store local
    preferences on your device.


    2. Usage Data

    We may collect anonymous
    usage statistics to improve the game experience.


    3. Third-Party Services

    The
    game may use third-party services that have their own privacy policies.


    4.
    Data Storage

    All game progress and settings are stored locally on your device.


    5.
    Children''s Privacy

    We do not knowingly collect information from children
    under 13.


    6. Changes to This Policy

    We may update this privacy policy
    from time to time. Changes will be reflected in the "Last updated" date.


    7.
    Contact

    For questions about this privacy policy, please contact the developer.'
